  abstract               = {In the dynamic realm of financial forecasting, predictive analytics has increasingly relied on advanced machine learning techniques. This research work evaluates the integration of reinforcement learning with standard predictive models to improve gold price prediction and trading techniques. We proposed an A2C model, leveraging policy and value-based approaches, adapts to real-time market conditions, and aims to maximize cumulative profit while minimizing risk. The results imply that the A2C agent outperforms traditional returns and risk management techniques. This paper advances predictive analytics by demonstrating the advantages of integrating Random Forest for prediction and A2C for trade optimization, providing a novel approach to adaptive financial decision-making. © 2026 selection and editorial matter, Dr. Poonam Nandal, Dr. Mamta Dahiya, Dr. Meeta Singh, Dr. Arvind Dagur, Dr. Brijesh Kumar. All rights reserved.},
