tasks like providing the Sowing Advisory service, disease prediction, price forecasting model, weather forecasting model, harvest time prediction, optimal use of fertilizers and pesticides, etc. A detailed survey of the work done in this regard is presented in this chapter. © 2025 selection and editorial matter, Payal Bansal, Rajeev Kumar, Ashwani Kumar and Daniel D. Dasig, Jr.; individual chapters, the contributors.},
