  abbrev_source_title    = {IEEE Global Conf. Adv. Technol., GCAT},
  abstract               = {The economy of our country is based on the shoulders of agriculture. However, the sector has been influenced in recent years by unstable price movements and unstable weather patterns. Due to such uncertainties, the farmers typically bear most of the losses and crop wastage. Their problems could be further complicated by the fact that farmers are not always aware of the ideal crop variety for their soil. A robust and user-friendly system has been built to address such issues. Decision Tree Regression Algorithm of Machine Learning is applied by the system to provide precise predictions for crop prices. The most significant variables when price prediction is to be made are rainfall, wholesale price index, month, and year. This plan ensures that farmers and the nation's economy get the most profits by providing them with pre-estimate prices, which give them the power to make informed decisions. The system includes weather forecast modules, crop and fertiliser recommendations, and a shop, chat website, and guide alongside price forecasts. To help farmers get the maximum out of their land, the crop recommendation module gives the most appropriate crop varieties based on the nature of the land. Farmers can plan their harvest and resources more effectively using the crop yield prediction module, which calculates how much crop they will harvest. The fertiliser recommendation module improves crop development and quality by recommending the appropriate fertilisers based on crop requirements and soil type. Generally, this process helps farmers a lot by giving them valuable information to enhance their operations and maximize their gains.  © 2025 IEEE.},
