  month     = {April},
  pages     = {1-6},
  abstract  = {The research shows how the combination of modern data analytics, machine learning, and IoT technologies has given farmers the power to make their decisions based on better information. Agri-Insight is a digital platform and full-featured tool that provides farmers with market prices, crop price predictions, weather forecasts, and AI-powered crop advice, as well as real-time crop health monitoring via a soil moisture sensor. The farmer can then manage their irrigation and preserve the soil's ideal conditions with accurate data from the sensor in the field. The Live Price module updates the farmers on the market changes, while the Weather Forecast and AI Crop Advisor components give the farmers guidance on which crops to plant and when. Consequently, the tools lead to better decision-making, increased crop yields, and higher profits. Through an IoT soil moisture sensor, the farmers are able to check the soil condition in real time, and because of that, they will not only be able to cut down on the water consumed but also improve the health of the crops under the precision irrigation system that is controlled by data. It is the combination of digital intelligence and physical sensing that guarantees the farmer is both informed and has the necessary tools to take action, resulting in increased productivity and sustainability.},
