  abstract  = {This project is a decision support system, which is practically a help tool for farmers in India, that delivers the four major functionalities of the most suitable fertilizer recommendation, crop health monitoring, cold storage localization, and market price analysis to Indian farmers at different stages from sowing to sale. Soil Health Card data is used to make recommendations of suitable crops and balanced fertilizer doses, while satellite images serve to verify the health of the crops in the field. Local geolocation enables a farmer to locate the nearest cold storage that is crop, specific, so the farmer can keep his produce fresh and not get spoiled. The combination of mandi and online market price data is used as a basis for making sound selling decisions, which in turn lead to the farmers being more efficient and having higher incomes.},
